{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲清楚地连起了珍惜之物仍有分量、失落无法抹去这份关联、努力维持姿态反而使眷恋更加显著的因果链，也说明了自我控制与脆弱为何能够并存；但它对38–43小节的退落、44–65小节的再次聚力以及呼吸渐急等具体转折着墨不足，身体反应如何先于理解、又如何反过来加重不安也主要停留在概括层面。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙不仅解释了为何亲近感会与无法重新拥有的失落同时发生，还把身体先收紧、自持暂时稳住自己、反复用力使重申越来越急、最后疲倦而问题未解连成了可追踪的因果过程，并将不甘心放弃作为另一种独立动因保留下来；其不足是H1、H2及M系列编号在本题中缺少解释，且“欣慰和骄傲”等感受比听感记录明示的内容更进一步，部分推断仍需谨慎。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙的实质优势不在篇幅或故事完整度，而在于更具体地说明了段落起伏、身体反应和应对方式如何相互作用并改变当下感受，同时没有把自我控制与不甘强行合并为唯一动机，而它的额外推断尚不足以抵消这些解释上的增益。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5744332d-7786-489f-b476-67ae54787b1c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140703351422Z", "elapsed_seconds": 108.61, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:08:51.963149+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1395e90deddfaf2f69438aa1a2cad5eb98a420d1c20b5361b7aff3907f6a1a0d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1